      "answer": "`Client.send()` publishes a single event message to the Nimbus gateway and waits for an broker acknowledgement. It is the primary write path of the SDK and is safe to call concurrently from multiple threads on a shared `Client` instance. The call blocks until either the gateway acknowledges the event or the configured timeout elapses, whichever comes first.",
